		{
			dependencies: ["7C66BE0FE573C2D9"]
			description: [
				"The Ender Guardian was the first shulker who looked an enderman in the eyes. However he didn't look a NORMAL enderman in the eyes. It was Vaedric, the fallen wanderer. Vaedric got angry and basically threw him into the void. The shulker was falling and falling, but when he finally had the cooldown to teleport, he teleported into an end lab where they studied him and made him into a giant endstone golem. They installed mental blocks so he couldn't teleport away, and now he's known as the Astral Wrath."
				""
				"Race - Golem"
				"Type - Shulker"
				"Element - Ender"
				"Threat Level - &a☠☠&r"
