		{
			dependencies: ["3FCCA0CA67959FA9"]
			description: [
				"\"I remember the last time he has used the wrathful triheaded abomination, it helped us in the cleansing, however it harmed more than it aided. This one though, an upgraded version, seeping with fuel, wires and screws, though a prototype, still capable of untold destruction yet to be unleashed. This was the first time I was not afraid, but disturbed by Erebus. Collecting souls, imprisoning them in a corpse amalgam fueled with a star, and then recreating it entirely. It sits still in the abandoned factory, immovable until charged with the same star that fueled the lesser before...\""
				""
				"Threat Level - &4☠☠☠☠☠☠&r"
				"Theme - Apocalypse Fabrications &e(RGRedsky)&r"
