		{
			dependencies: ["0EE03ED3C947A388"]
			description: [
				"The Ancient Remnant is a dinosaur species that lived in the desert. However, the villagers decided to settle in the desert too. The dinosaurs did not like this, and tried to scare the villagers away. The villagers, shaken up and enraged, talked to their village ancient builder, who is the only builder capable of constructing a serpent artifact capable of imprisoning a desert dinosaur in the desert tomb. The villagers first built the temple, then they cursed it, and it has been resting there for hundereds of years. Today, it's a skeleton, but even stronger than before. You can wake it up in the desert pyramid."
				""
				"Race - Dinosaur"
				"Type - Desert"
				"Element - Earth"
				"Threat Level - &c☠☠☠☠☠&r"
			]
