		{
			dependencies: ["5155652A8307FBFF"]
			description: [
				"Scylla was a human that was very fond of electricity. She was a scientist that was one of the scientists that constructed The Wither. After the great Withering, she decided to make a machine of her own. It failed, catastrophically, and she was badly injured. The core she made - called a Tesla Bulb exploded and infused with her blood. She wanted to rule as she discovered her powers, but failed again because her powers were unstable and they took over, guiding her into an acropolis. She knows she can't escape because of the guards blocking her path and due to her being unable to fly, so she accepted her fate and rests in the center of the arena."
				""
