			dependencies: ["149ACE565DBC0C6A"]
			description: [
				"Lord Pumpkinhead is a stronger version of Sir Pumpkinhead, and it has 3 phases: 1. He rides his horse and attacks you with numerous patterns 2. He jumps off of his horse and both him and his horse start attacking you 3. His head deattaches from his body and it's almost invulnerable to ranged attacks."
