		{
			dependencies: ["71E92084078D4A7B"]
			description: [
				"\"I remember back when Erebus was testing this one. It was one of the strongest sentinels he has ever constructed. Created to bring order to the Nether. All bowed to Ignis, as he was ruthless and did not hesitate to execute. Reinforced with synthetic incandescent metals such as Ignitium, its power is immeasurable. Its defeat will cause its armies to scatter throughout the landscapes. However, as I know Erebus, this is definetly not his last catastrophic construct...\""
				""
				"Race - Knight"
				"Type - Infernal"
				"Element - Fire"
				"Threat Level - &6☠☠☠☠&r"
