		{
			dependencies: ["23E940D610750DF0"]
			description: [
				"\"I am seeing this machine for the first time too, mortal. I saw what kinds of fearmongering creations he made. I knew of what apocalyptic potential Erebus had. Yet I could have never predicted this. This \"Obliterator\" is truly deadly. It's equipped with weapons no being has ever witnessed. Not even I. I have no knowledge beyond this point. Good luck. You will be tested by it. You, indefinetly will fall too before its wrath..."
				""
				"Threat Level - &6☠☠☠☠&r"
				"Theme - Zenith Fabrications &e(PinPinNeon)&r"
