		{
			dependencies: [
				"73613CD2EBEC1AFB"
				"08E49E8749E783ED"
			]
			description: [
				"\"The Enchanters. What a shame. I thought they had grown in strength. Instead, they hit rock bottom. Humiliating. They had been known for their horrifying actions, their cursed rituals, and their immense sorcering power. I faced them once. We fought for a long time. They were strong then, yet they were no match. Only their final attempt to defeat me was their superior. He too, fell, and I stood victorious. Not much is known about them. Rumors say they hold the world together, even if their acts may disturb others.\""
				""
				""
				"Race - Villager"
				"Type - Archmage"
				"Element - Blood"
				"Threat Level - &4☠☠☠☠☠☠&r"
